```
(1) x.---x+  1 (2)  (x, y)  --  (y, x) (3)  x  .---  cons(left, right) (4)  cons(left, right) .---  x (5)  insert(n) ~ insert(2,x +  1) (6)  c  .---  PO ( 7 ) . P 0 .---  c (8)  insert(n) .---  has(n) ·
```

